function calDayStripHTML(){const today=todayStr(),byYear={},weeks=[];for(let week=0;week<5;week++){const cells=[];for(let i=0;i<7;i++){const date=calAddDays(_calDayFirstWeek,week*7+i);if(!roleCalDateValid(date)){cells.push('<span></span>');continue;}const p=calDateParts(date),map=byYear[p.y]||(byYear[p.y]=calEventsByYear(p.y)),events=map[date]||[],lunar=calLunarLabel(date);cells.push('<button class="cal-day-chip'+(i>=5?' cal-weekend':'')+(date===today?' today':'')+(date===_calSelected?' selected':'')+'" data-cal-day="'+date+'" aria-label="查看日期 '+date+'" aria-pressed="'+(date===_calSelected)+'" onclick="'+calCall('calDayPick',date)+'"><span class="cal-date-stack"><strong>'+p.d+'</strong><small>'+esc(lunar.text)+'</small></span>'+(events.length?'<i style="background:'+calEventColor(events[0])+'"></i>':'')+'</button>');}weeks.push('<section class="cal-day-strip-week">'+cells.join('')+'</section>');}return weeks.join('');}
function calDayStripScrolled(box){if(_calDayStripLoading||!_calDayView||_calSearchOpen||S!==_calDayUiState||actId()!==_calDayUiOwner)return;const width=box.clientWidth;if(!width)return;let shift=0;if(box.scrollLeft<width*.1&&_calDayFirstWeek>'1900-01-01')shift=-14;else if(box.scrollLeft>box.scrollWidth-width*1.1&&calAddDays(_calDayFirstWeek,34)<'2100-12-31')shift=14;if(!shift)return;_calDayStripLoading=true;const left=box.scrollLeft;_calDayFirstWeek=calAddDays(_calDayFirstWeek,shift);box.innerHTML=calDayStripHTML();box.scrollLeft=left-shift/7*width;requestAnimationFrame(()=>{_calDayStripLoading=false;});}
function calDayNowHTML(date){if(date!==todayStr())return '';const now=new Date(),minutes=now.getHours()*60+now.getMinutes(),time=String(now.getHours()).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2,'0');return '<div id="cal_day_now" class="cal-day-now" style="top:'+minutes/60*CAL_DAY_HOUR_PX+'px"><span>'+time+'</span><i></i></div>';}
function calDayTimeHTML(date){const rows=calDayRows(date),loose=rows.filter(e=>e.allDay||!calTimeValue(e.time||e.startTime)||e.type==='period'),items=calDayLayout(calDayItems(date)),ticks=[];for(let h=0;h<=24;h++)ticks.push('<div class="cal-day-hour" style="top:'+h*CAL_DAY_HOUR_PX+'px"><span>'+String(h).padStart(2,'0')+':00</span><i></i></div>');const blocks=items.map(item=>{const e=item.e,occurrence=e._occurrenceDate||e.date,height=item.point?25:Math.max(2,(item.end-item.start)/60*CAL_DAY_HOUR_PX),color=calEventColor(e),label=(e.time||e.startTime||'')+(!item.point&&e.endTime?' – '+e.endTime:'');return '<button class="cal-day-time-item'+(item.point?' point':height<22?' short':'')+(e.completed?' completed':'')+'" style="top:'+item.start/60*CAL_DAY_HOUR_PX+'px;left:calc(55px + (100% - 65px) * '+item.column/item.columns+');width:calc((100% - 65px) / '+item.columns+' - 3px);height:'+height+'px;--cal-color:'+color+'" aria-label="查看 '+calAttr(e.title)+' '+calAttr(label)+'" onclick="'+calCall('calEventOpen',e.id,occurrence)+'">'+(item.point?'<i></i>':'')+'<span><strong>'+esc(e.title||'未命名记录')+'</strong>'+'</span></button>';}).join('');return (loose.length?'<section class="cal-day-loose"><h3>全天与无具体时间的事项</h3>'+loose.map(e=>e.type==='reminder'?calReminderAgendaRow(e):'<button class="cal-day-loose-event" onclick="'+calCall('calEventOpen',e.id,e._occurrenceDate||e.date)+'"><i style="background:'+calEventColor(e)+'"></i>'+esc(e.title)+'</button>').join('')+'</section>':'')+calUndatedReminderHTML()+'<div id="cal_day_grid" class="cal-day-time-grid" style="height:'+24*CAL_DAY_HOUR_PX+'px">'+ticks.join('')+blocks+calDayNowHTML(date)+(rows.length?'':'<p class="cal-day-no-events">当天暂无已安排的日程</p>')+'</div>';}
